優惠。\n5.監督都更：敦促鐵路高架化都更計劃執行到位。\n三、扶助弱勢照顧老大人\n1.福利透明：敦促社福措施更透明，濟弱扶傾顧老人、好請好領好便民。\n2.友善整合：敦促社福與特教橫向對接，整合單一窗口、友善家有喜憨兒。\n3.六十正好：公辦高年級不老專案、推動「樂齡再起」媒合平台。","reviewDecision":{"version":"internal-platform-review-ui-v2","decision":"approve","reviewedAt":"2026-08-15T07:36:28.220Z"},"sourceDocument":{"url":"https://bulletin.cec.gov.tw/01%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E5%85%AC%E5%A0%B1/06%E7%B8%A3%E5%B8%82%E8%AD%B0%E5%93%A1/111%E5%B9%B4/22%E5%98%89%E7%BE%A9%E5%B8%82/%E5%98%89%E7%BE%A9%E5%B8%82%E7%AC%AC2%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E5%8D%80.pdf","file":"tmp/cec-representative-platforms/2022-councilor/pdfs/6484dfe5675ffbec4f9cb4bc.pdf","page":1,"sha256":"1410168b31a6f32c6fa9225da2665fefca552fae0bca3139f7245331e398d1de","layoutFile":null,"extractionMethod":"needs_manual_localization"},"electionContext":{"raceId":"b128f9f4-bf1b-4472-b852-09e79cb4b259","electionId":"9947ae7e-c242-4911-bcf3-72d2f0f5517d","candidateId":"68310813-4bec-4636-bc9a-7087bdef5808"},"publicationGate":{"reason":"Election-scoped CEC platform text accepted; minor transcription errors may remain","status":"passed","reviewedAt":"2026-08-15T07:36:28.220Z"},"campaignPlatformReview":{"reason":"Exact person and candidacy were confirmed before publication","status":"passed","reviewedAt":"2026-08-15T07:36:28.220Z"}},"confidence_level":"B","review_status":"verified","visibility":"public","source_name":"中央選舉委員會：2022年選舉公報","source_url":"https://bulletin.cec.gov.tw/01%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E5%85%AC%E5%A0%B1/06%E7%B8%A3%E5%B8%82%E8%AD%B0%E5%93%A1/111%E5%B9%B4/22%E5%98%89%E7%BE%A9%E5%B8%82/%E5%98%89%E7%BE%A9%E5%B8%82%E7%AC%AC2%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E5%8D%80.pdf","observed_at":"2022-11-25T16:00:00+00:00","is_public":true,"created_at":"2026-08-14T15:35:43.706522+00:00","updated_at":"2026-08-15T07:36:28.22+00:00","review_score":60,"scoring_version":"cec-elected-platform-review-v1","scoring_reasons":["Central Election Commission election bulletin","Exact elected candidate and race match","Private source evidence awaiting manual localization",{"version":"internal-